Package: libfmodex-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: i386 amd64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libfmodex4 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: FMOD Ex cross platform audio library - development files
 FMOD is a cross platform audio library and toolset to let you easily
 implement the latest audio technologies into your title.
 .
 The FMOD Ex sound system is an audio engine for game developers,
 multimedia developers, sound designers, musicians and audio engineers,
 based on the years of experience of Firelight Technologies' previous
 product FMOD 3. It is written from the ground up and aims to push the
 boundaries of audio implementation for games while using minimal
 resources and being scalable.
 .
 This package contains the header files, the pkg-config file and the
 libfmodex.so link needed to do development with FMOD Ex.

Package: libfmodex4
Architecture: i386 amd64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 NSHPIPEWIREALSA,
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends}
Recommends:
 libpulse0
Description: FMOD Ex cross platform audio library - runtime library
 FMOD is a cross platform audio library and toolset to let you easily
 implement the latest audio technologies into your title.
 .
 The FMOD Ex sound system is an audio engine for game developers,
 multimedia developers, sound designers, musicians and audio engineers,
 based on the years of experience of Firelight Technologies' previous
 product FMOD 3. It is written from the ground up and aims to push the
 boundaries of audio implementation for games while using minimal
 resources and being scalable.
 .
 This package contains the shared library libfmodex.so.4. Audio output
 libraries (ALSA, PulseAudio) are loaded at runtime.
